23
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:27,580
That status change is the whole guard.

24
00:01:27,580 --> 00:01:32,180
A processed hire leaves the filter, so nothing ever runs twice.

25
00:01:32,180 --> 00:01:36,460
Adding a new market means adding one row, not editing the workflow.

26
00:01:36,460 --> 00:01:40,860
You add the hire, and within a minute the paperwork is moving.

27
